      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Using different electromagnetic fields we investigated reactions of brain by different methods (psychophysical, behavioural, electrographical and morphological). We discover nonspecific initial adaptive reaction of brain (IARB). This IARB include weak pain, inhibition of learning, EEG reaction of synchronisation and activation neuroglia."},
